fixture wall_cling_buffered_jump
doc BUILD.md s5 Jump "Jump buffer 8 f"; docs/adr/0010: a jump pressed before a cling fires on the cling frame, as one pressed before landing does
room test/shaft
spawn 700 300
frames 40
input
  # The air jump is spent at once; the second press, falling toward the wall, is buffered.
  0 jump
  1..7 R
  8 R jump
  9..39 R
end
expect
  at 0 event.air_jump=1
  mark cling 4..39 event.wall_cling=1
  at cling event.wall_kick=1
end
